+# Plain HTTP for internal hosts
+
+The project's current recorded decision is "HTTPS everywhere, no exceptions": internal hosts are not exempt, so plain HTTP is not permitted for them and they are to be reached over HTTPS like any other host. This position comes from a statement made in a project session; it has not been confirmed by a commit or other stronger evidence, so treat it as the latest recorded direction rather than a verified, enforced rule.
